This Power BI Desktop project was developed to support management in monitoring key business performance indicators (KPIs), comparing regional performance,
analyzing product-level trends, and identifying high-value customers. The solution consists of multiple interactive dashboards that provide a comprehensive view of
the company's performance and operations. Each dashboard incorporates a variety of visual elements, including charts, line graphs, KPI cards, and dynamic slicers,
enabling users to filter and explore data efficiently. These interactive visualizations help managers gain actionable insights, identify trends and opportunities,
and make data-driven decisions by presenting complex business information in a clear, intuitive, and accessible format.
